  "contentHtml": "\n\n<main>\n<section class=\"era-hero\">\n<div class=\"container era-hero-grid reveal\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">NIGHT · COMPLETE ERA INDEX</p>\n<h1>Era<br/>Archive</h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"era-hero-copy\">\n<p>2022년의 첫 자정부터 2029년 잠시 숨을 고르는 밤까지. 음악, 멤버 구성과 콘셉트의 변화로 이어지는 NIGHT의 열여섯 시대.</p>\n<a href=\"#era-timeline\">BEGIN WITH MIDNIGHT <span>↓</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"시대 바로가기\" class=\"era-quick-nav\">\n<div class=\"container\"><a href=\"#after-midnight\">01 AFTER MIDNIGHT</a><a href=\"#nocturne\">02 NOCTURNE</a><a href=\"#eclipse\">03 ECLIPSE</a><a href=\"#no-signal\">04 NO SIGNAL</a><a href=\"#new-moon\">05 NEW MOON</a><a href=\"#lucid\">06 LUCID</a><a href=\"#phantom\">07 PHANTOM</a><a href=\"#after-hours\">08 AFTER HOURS</a><a href=\"#complete\">09 COMPLETE</a><a href=\"#infinity\">10 INFINITY</a><a href=\"#sensational\">11 SENSATIONAL</a><a href=\"#wings\">12 WINGS</a><a href=\"#persona\">13 PERSONA</a><a href=\"#nightmare\">14 NIGHTMARE</a><a href=\"#paradox\">15 PARADOX</a><a href=\"#rest\">16 REST</a></div>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"section era-timeline\" id=\"era-timeline\">\n<div class=\"container era-list\">\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"discography.html#after-midnight\" id=\"after-midnight\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">01</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"AFTER MIDNIGHT 시대 NIGHT\" src=\"assets/images/visual-archive/after-midnight.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2022.11.15 · DEBUT MINI ALBUM</small><strong>AFTER MIDNIGHT</strong><em>자정이 지난 순간, NIGHT의 시간이 시작된다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>ORIGINAL FIVE</b><b>TITLE · AFTER MIDNIGHT</b><b>BIRTH OF NIGHT</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"discography.html#nocturne\" id=\"nocturne\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">02</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"NOCTURNE 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/visual-archive/nocturne.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>1ST YEAR · 1ST MINI ALBUM</small><strong>NOCTURNE</strong><em>아름다운 밤일수록, 빠져나오는 길은 더 희미해진다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>GOTHIC ELEGANCE</b><b>TITLE · OBSESSION</b><b>SEDUCTION</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"discography.html#eclipse\" id=\"eclipse\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">03</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"ECLIPSE 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/visual-archive/eclipse.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2ND YEAR · 2ND MINI ALBUM</small><strong>ECLIPSE</strong><em>달이 가려진 자리에서, 서로의 그림자만 길어진다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>LAST ORIGINAL FIVE</b><b>TITLE · SHADOW PLAY</b><b>FRACTURE</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card era-card-signal reveal\" href=\"discography.html#no-signal\" id=\"no-signal\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">04</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"NO SIGNAL · DOHA, IHWAN, JIWOO, WOOHYUN 4인 체제\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/visual-archive/no-signal.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2ND YEAR · DIGITAL SINGLE</small><strong>NO SIGNAL</strong><em>아무 대답 없는 밤에도, 남겨진 신호는 사라지지 않는다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>FOUR MEMBER ERA</b><b>DIGITAL SINGLE</b><b>SILENCE</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"discography.html#new-moon\" id=\"new-moon\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">05</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"TAEHOON 합류 후 NEW MOON 시대의 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/visual-archive/new-moon.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2ND YEAR · 3RD MINI ALBUM</small><strong>NEW MOON</strong><em>보이지 않는 달 아래, 다섯 개의 그림자가 다시 하나가 된다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>TAEHOON JOINS</b><b>TITLE · REBORN</b><b>NEW FIVE</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"discography.html#lucid\" id=\"lucid\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">06</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"현재 5인 체제의 LUCID 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/visual-archive/lucid.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>3RD YEAR · 4TH MINI ALBUM</small><strong>LUCID</strong><em>꿈이라는 걸 알면서도, 우리는 끝내 눈을 뜨지 않는다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · DREAMWALKER</b><b>DREAM</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"discography.html#phantom\" id=\"phantom\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">07</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"PHANTOM 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/gallery/thumbs/phantom-a-group.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2026.09.14 · MINI ALBUM</small><strong>PHANTOM</strong><em>현실과 허상의 경계에서, 진짜를 바라본다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · ILLUSION</b><b>BOUNDARY</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"after-hours.html\" id=\"after-hours\">\n<span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">08</span>\n<span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"AFTER HOURS 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2026/after-hours/concept-group.webp\"/></span>\n<span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2026.12.10 · WINTER SPECIAL ALBUM</small><strong>AFTER HOURS</strong><em>아침이 오지 않아도, 밤은 우리 곁에 남는다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · NO SUNRISE</b><b>4AM</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"complete-2027.html\" id=\"complete\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">09</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"COMPLETE 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2027/complete/complete-026.webp\"/></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2027.05.01 · FULL ALBUM</small><strong>COMPLETE</strong><em>완성된 순간에도, 우리의 밤은 끝나지 않는다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · NOT FINISH</b><b>ORBIT / CONVERGENCE</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"infinity-2027.html\" id=\"infinity\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">10</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"INFINITY 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2027/infinity/infinity-033.webp\"/></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2027.08.01 · MINI ALBUM</small><strong>INFINITY</strong><em>반복을 깨고, 무한을 다시 시작한다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · RESTART</b><b>LOOP / EXPANSION</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"sensational-2027.html\" id=\"sensational\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">11</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"SENSATIONAL 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2027/sensational/sensatio-016.webp\"/></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2027.10.01 · MINI ALBUM</small><strong>SENSATIONAL</strong><em>달빛 아래, 검은 호랑이가 밤을 깨운다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · 범(虎)</b><b>BLACK TIGER</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"wings-2028.html\" id=\"wings\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">12</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"WINGS 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2028/wings/wings-009.webp\" style=\"object-fit:contain\"></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2028.02.01 · MINI ALBUM</small><strong>WINGS</strong><em>ANGEL과 FALLEN, 빛과 상흔 사이의 경계를 따라가는 WINGS의 공식 기록.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · 경계 (BETWEEN)</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a><a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"persona-2028.html\" id=\"persona\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">13</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"PERSONA 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2028/persona/persona-063.webp\" style=\"object-fit:contain\"></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2028.08.21 · MINI ALBUM</small><strong>PERSONA</strong><em>DAY와 NIGHT, 두 얼굴로 이어지는 PERSONA의 콘셉트와 앨범, 뮤직비디오 스틸 및 무대 기록.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · 탈환 (TAKE IT BACK)</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"nightmare-2029.html\" id=\"nightmare\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">14</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"NIGHTMARE 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2029/nightmare/nightmare-release.webp\"/></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2029.02.23 · ALBUM</small><strong>NIGHTMARE</strong><em>도망치던 악몽의 끝에서, NIGHT 자신들이 악몽의 실체였음이 드러난다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · BLACK NIGHT</b><b>CONTROL / PLEASURE / NARCISSISM / DECEPTION / GREED</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n<a class=\"era-card reveal\" href=\"paradox-2029.html\" id=\"paradox\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">15</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"PARADOX 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2029/paradox/comeback/15.webp\"/></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2029.08.27 · ALBUM</small><strong>PARADOX</strong><em>완벽하게 아름다운 낙원 앞에서, 완벽함이 정말 행복인지 질문한다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · PARADISE</b><b>PERFECT PARADISE / CONTRADICTION</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n<a class=\"era-card era-card-current reveal\" href=\"discography.html#rest\" id=\"rest\"><span class=\"era-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"era-index\">16</span><span class=\"era-image\"><img alt=\"REST 시대 NIGHT\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/images/2029/rest/release.webp\"/></span><span class=\"era-copy\"><small>2029.11.02 · DIGITAL SINGLE</small><strong>REST</strong><em>긴 밤의 끝에서 잠시 숨을 고르고, 다음 시간을 향해 조용히 나아간다.</em><span class=\"era-facts\"><b>CURRENT FIVE</b><b>TITLE · NEXT TIME</b><b>REST / HEALING</b></span><i>OPEN ERA RECORD →</i></span></a>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section-tight era-footer-link\">\n<div class=\"container reveal\"><div><span class=\"section-kicker\">Full Music Record</span><h2>Every track. Every night.</h2><p>앨범별 트랙리스트와 세부 기록은 전체 디스코그래피에서 이어집니다.</p></div><a class=\"btn\" href=\"discography.html\">VIEW DISCOGRAPHY</a></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n",
